{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "053da25295accc9f1b942d5d5dee5474ef35ee3118ed95614d6397822d843888", "ja": "長いフライトを終え、ニューヨークに到着し\nたアイドル達。心の故郷、アイムカムバック\nと叫ぶ歩。真はサンドイッチを買おうとする\nが、言語の壁は厚い。助けを求められた歩も\n慌てるが、エレナが助けてくれるのだった。", "zh": "结束了漫长的飞行后，偶像们抵达了纽约。步高喊着“心灵的故乡，我回来了！”真想买三明治，却被语言的障碍难住了。被求助的步也慌了起来，不过艾蕾娜出手帮忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "728becf5c532687a91b219fbea198609353be078c0b7ab448ac63f52b2f97e41", "ja": "（長いフライトに不安そうな歩を横目に、アイドル達は\n思い思いに過ごし、無事ニューヨークに到着した！）", "zh": "（看着对长途飞行感到不安的步，偶像们各自做着想做的事，平安抵达了纽约！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0103020881839d55984243e053dbcc5edbc34f3ffe007056a5f3abf4938d7410", "ja": "着いたーーー！　うん、これぞニューヨークの空気！\nアタシの心の故郷！　アイム、カムバーック！！", "zh": "到了———！嗯，这就是纽约的空气！\n我心灵的故乡！I’m back！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ea387635cd0ef1a51c980e652ca0806c1a45e0723f73af7d01b3c50e00edc209", "ja": "歩、なんかすげー元気になったよなー。\n飛行機の中じゃ、ずーっと大人しかったのにさ。", "zh": "步，你好像一下子精神多了啊。明明在飞机里一直都安安静静的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d75571bf83ff5c0d4898a3f4105a0edd13d87c8c9bba7403ceb5ff87517c0c52", "ja": "うん、やっぱ飛行機じゃぜんぜん寝れなかったしね！\nでも、なんか空気吸ったら、元気になってきた！", "zh": "嗯，毕竟在飞机上完全睡不着嘛！\n不过，一呼吸到这里的空气，就感觉打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e288c3529aa5ceb42ec30a4de2679cb0e3eea1d36541d17248024a9b371d052", "ja": "アハッ、ワタシがブラジルに着いたら、\n踊りたくなっちゃうのと同じだネ♪", "zh": "啊哈，我一到巴西，就会和现在一样忍不住想跳舞呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "65d9100726d34970d5fe634d4666ccab4a64b47e6c0503ceff02ccaa539166a2", "ja": "真は大丈夫なの？　最初あんなにはしゃいでたのに、\nいつの間にかヨロヨロしちゃってるけど？", "zh": "真没事吧？一开始明明还那么兴奋，不知不觉都摇摇晃晃的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "69aef14f0728fbc0598737db84dee3811699f2e77851150821b675b731e52b2b", "ja": "ありがとう……ちょっと、シートが狭くてさ……。\nボク、狭いトコ苦手だから……。うーん……はあ～。", "zh": "谢谢你……就是，座位有点窄……\n我不太适应狭窄的地方……唔……哈啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "5da8872443461a87b2184510cf3400f4806cd87f3f675c2b2e4b8a2c5db970d4", "ja": "よしっ、もう大丈夫！　{$P$}、\nこの後はホテルに行くんでしたっけ？", "zh": "好，已经没事了！{$P$}，接下来是要去酒店，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9b75514938ed816f0bff3d08c2d8718646592d050a7666172cffca6a21431556", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。このまま軽く見て回ったら、\nみんなでホテルに向かうぞ。", "zh": "啊，对。这之后随便逛逛，我们就一起去酒店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "dfc58b50b9988d2818cbf25bb06022660464a32ce7514aa002535bbca164d21e", "ja": "ふわ～……オレ、すげー眠くなってきた……。\nう～っ、せっかくニューヨーク着いたのに～！", "zh": "哈啊～……我越来越困了……。\n呜～，明明好不容易才到纽约的嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a83ea435fef960f58b54c5c563e7e24ab53a902e7a9732b9df97ac0884fbba5", "ja": "フライト中は、スバルが一番元気だったのにネ。\nでも、ワタシも……ふわ～。", "zh": "飞行途中，昴明明是最有精神的呢。\n不过，我也……呼啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9a5a917e55a8f6752193ed23b5c683981dc6f98dcaad98caefa34a446694805f", "ja": "とりあえず、ホテルまでは寝ないでくれよ。", "zh": "总之，在到酒店之前可别睡着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f3a8b6dce418157d10c7345f3e40cf55c59fca7c2b90ffc8f9e0f507013d4c3", "ja": "いやあ、懐かしいな～、この街並み！\nあっ、ほら！　あれがエンパイアステートビル！", "zh": "哎呀，真让人怀念啊～这街景！\n啊，你看！那就是帝国大厦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "e0be81298957473ce82a8040650ce7b2e27767bed3e32543bd9279c9085c6c4e", "ja": "うわ～！　本物だよ、本物～！\n映画で登ったりしてるとこだよね！　おんなじだー！", "zh": "哇～！是真家伙，真的是本尊耶～！\n就是电影里往上爬的那个地方吧！一模一样啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "67dd0cd33310b73cde3ac9c7ca9d85b63355beed5b222fe2b3232218d648f600", "ja": "ホンモノは、やっぱり迫力があるよネ！\nそれに、すっごく高いヨー！", "zh": "真的还是很有气势呢！\n而且超高的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d278dc08fc30c7d1cc0b950bd47db9d2558b89936c87a842cb647a0b014b3829", "ja": "でしょ～！　頂上は……えっと、何メートルだっけ。\nまあ、忘れちゃったけど、とにかく高いんだよ！", "zh": "对吧～！顶端……呃，来着？有多少米来着。\n嘛，虽然忘了，不过总之就是很高啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "0a194e3d5bc58b78c7c9f95ef64055dacbf1637a89febcc1ed571fbbb99e38e9", "ja": "うん、すっげー高い！\nそれに、他のビルとかも全部高い！　すっげー！", "zh": "嗯，超级高！\n而且其他大楼也都好高啊！好厉害——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "37d340fb3b5a0620c8c64df46c1d22725638d8ee98056c024798515fd37866cf", "ja": "あはは、昴もすっかり元気になったね！\nあ、{$P$}、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "啊哈哈，昂也完全恢复精神了呢！\n啊，{$P$}，可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c3b27e630bdd2c6d990cc1b49d692dee6fd1c622e6571ef0fd5345cb68fa01af", "ja": "ん？　どうかしたのか、真？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "89e9180dc3705bb9b0be42f75c0adff100b83078b23a5cb60c8c84a7c205869f", "ja": "ホテルに着くの、もう少し先になりますよね？\nボク、ちょっとお腹が空いたなー、なんて。", "zh": "到酒店还要一会儿吧？\n我有点饿了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "0f56a804b5058dd1da40ea0b92fd0b899cb1cd2663b4d0472eb4f6281511d3c7", "ja": "アタシも何か食べたい！　機内食も美味しかったけど、\nやっぱ現地のご飯を食べないと！", "zh": "我也想吃点什么！虽然飞机餐也很好吃，但果然还是得尝尝当地的美食！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "48a34bfecf391be1cf7815184da5e3ed5e8db60f2e3bf32fef6cfa5a4c3d22e9", "ja": "あっ、ほら、サンドイッチのお店があるヨ♪\nとってもおいしそうだネ！", "zh": "啊，你看，那边有卖三明治的店♪\n看起来特别好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "26eef810d0d78ab3e7dd4baa1cb6644e27c00e907566840c91922bc78d5b4d0a", "ja": "ホントだ！　あ、でも、ちゃんと注文できるかな？\nオレ、英語なんて全然自信ないからさ～。", "zh": "真的耶！啊，不过，我们能顺利点餐吗？\n我对英语可是一点自信都没有啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "cb6283cd2de80c85a3e72941e588974a5ebe3215d8ada084687891154b4dc66a", "ja": "そっか。店員さんにオーダーしなきゃいけないんだ。\nたしかに……ちょっとドキドキするね。", "zh": "这样啊。得跟店员点单才行。\n确实……还真有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d9ff1b5e11c1965c63b27bdf249d8935b32124c75fabeb65096fa8d59192c4fb", "ja": "大丈夫だって。\n気持ちなんて、勢いで伝わるからさ！", "zh": "没事的啦。\n这种心情，只要靠气势就能传达过去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "fbbe0c77ba0a4e5c94d0fb86bff816d59aebcd8412d8930787dc6c0cccf53fc5", "ja": "たしかに！　前に行った南の島でも、\nボディランゲージで、なんとかなってたよ！", "zh": "确实！之前去南方小岛的时候，\n靠肢体语言也总能想办法解决呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "76739eafc6da9e63a51efa6cfa5ba64b52292a8375454873bd3f976bba6612e5", "ja": "そうそう！　ハートがあれば大丈夫だヨー♪", "zh": "对对！只要有心意就没问题啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "90ec899dbc0843992f693ecd8be89239eec1eea7d3e7db855c2a8ec6ad7717a8", "ja": "ハートがあれば……。うん、そうだよね！\nよーし、勇気を出して……ボク、挑戦してみるよ！", "zh": "只要有心……嗯，没错！\n好——鼓起勇气……我来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e40c7fc1cf2360c5f2a803bb10903ea19bd63c9193b8912b2796e6fe164dbc29", "ja": "（真は緊張しながらも店に向かった。\n本人の経験のため、ここは見守ってみよう）", "zh": "（真虽然有些紧张，还是朝店里走去了。为了让她亲自积累经验，这里就先在旁边看着吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "8bd5d12eb7c87391f77ccd89a34b7959cff3495c428e48975cb917f9c4a612fb", "ja": "あの、すみま……じゃなくて、エクスキューズミー！\nえっと、テイクアウトプリーズ！", "zh": "那个，不好意……不对，Excuse me！\n那个，Takeout please！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1030_tenin", "source_sha256": "089be629607b47acfefa98bd7f4e0ced87cc449358e4d25e1b7f0c0461a4333f", "ja": "ペラペラペラペラペラペラ、ペラペラ。\nペラペラペラ、ペラペーラ？", "zh": "叽里呱啦叽里呱啦叽里呱啦叽里呱啦叽里呱啦叽里呱啦，叽里呱啦。\n叽里呱啦叽里呱啦，叽里呱啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "68ea63d1e5588ff559a118dfcc493029690a00f0ac29191fbabbe45690a77357", "ja": "ふむふむ……ダメだ、全然わからないよ！\n助けて歩！　ヘルプミー、プリーズ！", "zh": "嗯嗯……不行，完全听不懂啊！\n救救我，步！Help me, please！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "21f03ffff2c0a2a8deccd4374fa1d6288026fa1ec25ae76c1a7238da39d68763", "ja": "ええっ！？　いや、えーっと……\nあはは、ちょっと聞き取れなかったかな？", "zh": "诶！？不，那个……哈哈，刚才没听清吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "d520600872a211b6af4f904a0858f234522930fe608d471a8c50258aa386e921", "ja": "えええっ！？　そ、そんなあ～！", "zh": "诶诶诶！？怎、怎么会这样啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
