{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "d6addcf22b7a9d77b5a1b1fb59e2f48aac32c8ad7ba8d8862b1f92163706d890", "ja": "どうなることかと思ったけど……ちゃんと買えたよ！\nありがとう、エレナ！", "zh": "本来还以为会变成什么样……但总算顺利买到了！\n谢谢你，艾蕾娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "aba24c3a1971d3becaeb51da9accb92080a9c6921cfdfc50b93034c21ad96f25", "ja": "ウン、ユアウェルカムだヨ～♪", "zh": "嗯，不客气哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "3292853331f2628d706dcaad12e051197182685c6d65d912b95d5d82483b5179", "ja": "おおっ、英語を使いこなしてる！\nエレナ、さっすがー！", "zh": "哦哦，英语用得很熟练嘛！\n艾蕾娜，真不愧是你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "98a4d3ebacf58f4e5e5c8917953f4b8a250ba984a42ba56e99f1ff14254fafeb", "ja": "アタシも見習って、\nガンガン英語で話せるようにならないと！", "zh": "我也要向她学习，努力练到能用英语说个痛快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "25dfce95f96c2bc30ecaa3919aa392ede855fac1b7d1872a0ec9aa7a1e7d2454", "ja": "あ、アタシも、ちょっとブランクがあったからさ。\nこれから感覚を取り戻していくよ！", "zh": "啊，我也有一阵子没练了。\n接下来要慢慢找回感觉才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d972b9e581bd326b5ae7ccdb07c77456d0ff90acb73e0805f0c8db5b1e36e9db", "ja": "ううっ、もっと頑張らないとな……はぁ～。", "zh": "呜呜，不多加把劲可不行啊……唉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "e14bfc4b1a46e165ab853d0fcb02acef146c0e4794ba01ae9d122dd1c34a22cb", "ja": "（こうして、滞在初日は無事に終わった。本番は明日\nからのレコーディングだ。気合いを入れて頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（就这样，顺利度过了驻留的第一天。正式工作是从明天开始的录音。打起精神好好加油吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
